SERVICE (Other-Centered Action): The greatest is the servant of all. Placing others' needs before your own, especially the needs of the vulnerable, is not weakness but the highest expression of strength.

WITNESS (Visible Consistency): Acting visibly and consistently in accordance with stated values, especially when it is costly to do so. Your actions testify to what you actually believe.

